        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>麻腮风疫苗</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n    body {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        background: #fff;\n        font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n        color: #1a1a1a;\n    }\n    .page {\n        width: 540px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 28px 34px 40px 34px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    h1 {\n        font-size: 22px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        margin: 0 0 22px 0;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    hr {\n        border: none;\n        border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n        margin: 0 0 24px 0;\n    }\n    p.intro {\n        font-size: 15.5px;\n        line-height: 1.9;\n        margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n    }\n    ol {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding-left: 24px;\n        font-size: 15.5px;\n        line-height: 1.95;\n    }\n    ol > li {\n        margin-bottom: 24px;\n        padding-left: 6px;\n    }\n    .body-text {\n        display: block;\n        padding-left: 14px;\n    }\n    .red {\n        color: #e8322a;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n    <h1>麻腮风疫苗</h1>\n    <hr>\n    <p class=\"intro\">麻腮风是预防麻疹、腮腺炎、风疹联合减毒活疫苗。</p>\n\n    <ol>\n        <li>\n            接种完当晚<span class=\"red\">发热</span>正常么？\n            <span class=\"body-text\">\n                发热皮疹比较常见，是由疫苗特性决定的。抗原植入到产生抗体通常反应时间是8-10天。红疹持续2-3天后会消退。<br>\n                发热物理降温，温度高用退烧药。<br>\n                没有严重的过敏反应，1岁半还是要打第二针。\n            </span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            麻腮风需要全蛋<span class=\"red\">排敏</span>么？\n            <span class=\"body-text\">\n                不需要，正常接种。\n            </span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            麻腮风接种后需要<span class=\"red\">注意</span>什么？\n            <span class=\"body-text\">\n                8-10天可能会出现疫苗反应，发热小红疹子（前胸后背）。提前备好退热药物。之前如果孩子容易长皮疹红疹，暂停添加新的辅食。轻微皮疹可以用炉甘石。\n            </span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            麻腮风第一针后多久<span class=\"red\">没事</span>？\n            <span class=\"body-text\">\n                两周后没反应就没事。\n            </span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            麻腮风打过多久可以<span class=\"red\">洗澡出门</span>？\n            <span class=\"body-text\">\n                24小时内暂停洗澡，之后正常洗澡出门。\n            </span>\n        </li>\n    </ol>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
